GREEN MUSIC v7.2
Textual + Rich terminal music player for Termux, Termux-Proot Ubuntu and Ubuntu 24.04.

UI is intentionally based on the supplied musc-ui.py design: top bar, wide navigation
palette, Now Playing card, animated sine waveform, searchable playlist, Quick Actions,
Info card and minimal volume toast.

Playback/features retained from the previous Green Music player:
- local music discovery under ~/Music (recursive)
- direct/radio URLs
- YouTube URL -> stream with yt-dlp
- YouTube video/playlist -> MP3 download
- custom.txt batch download via C
- mpv JSON IPC backend
- progress click seeking
- touch/click buttons and playlist rows
- SPACE, Y, D, C, N, P, S, R, M, L, H, A, Q and arrow keys
- mobile keyboard-aware layout
"""

